{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港及內地紅星昨晚雲集香江，眾女星在紅地氈爭妍鬥麗，「本地薑」高海寧罕有谷「湯碗胸」狙擊內地新劇拍檔白鹿，白鹿身材雖然不及對方，但就清唱廣東歌《季候風》成功搶Fo！</p><p>一眾內地藝人來港不忘打卡，其中內地視后楊紫穿晚裝歎茶記，體驗香港地道文化。</p><p>&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:21:30.824663+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T16:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:42.084695+00:00","content_hash":"8b429ec915b9eee2e61aefd883a21c65ba293c964d9c900024b5c57d0440af33","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}